# 0.6.0 ceremony-genesis inputs: PUBLIC VALUES ONLY (no key material, ever).
# created: 2026-11-11 · branch: feat/v060-genesis-ceremony-builder · author: Larry Klosowski
# status: partial (updated 2026-11-11). DECIDED values are set below; PENDING ones are commented out and every
# script that reads them refuses to run until the owner supplies them (no defaults anywhere).
# Spec: contracts/script/lib/V060GenesisSpec.sol and V060GovernanceSpec.sol; inputs are
# classified in scripts/genesis/phase_inputs.json (P0 checks them).
R1007_V060_INPUTS_STATUS=partial
GENESIS_V060=1
# DECIDED (owner 2026-11-11): the GUARDIAN delay must leave 2 h inside the 24 h registry window.
GENESIS_GUARDIAN_VETO_MARGIN=7200
# PENDING (owner): the r1007 key inventory, role-tagged JSON {address: [roles]} (fed #467 §0.6).
# GENESIS_KEY_INVENTORY=
# PENDING (owner): the retired r1006 non-producer keys (D-K3), comma-separated public addresses.
# GENESIS_RETIRED_KEYS=
